==Event Information==
Time to face off against the world's strongest fighters!<br>
The Battle Cats face off against the warriors of Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition in a special crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available November 1st (11am) through November 15th, 2019 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" Limited Capsules!'''}}<br>
Enter the ring alongside legendary martial artists aiming for glory!<br>
Visit the Rare Capsule machine and tap the "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" tab for a chance to pick up Uber Rare collab characters!<br>
Here's your moment to recruit powerful heroes only available during this crossover event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Get the Limited Edition Collab Units below!'''}}<br>
[[Ryu (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Ryu (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks that strike enemies with Savage Blows!<br>
[[Chun-Li (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Chun-Li (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Kicks that Knockback Red, Black, and Aliens enemies!<br>
[[Guile (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Guile (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong defense vs Floating, plus Area Attack that Slow & Weaken enemies!<br>
[[Zangief (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Zangief (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Omnistrikes slam Zombies, preventing them from reviving! Plus, has a chance to dodge Zombie attacks!<br>
[[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Blanka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Omnistrike Damage to Aliens! Smash through enemy Barriers!<br>
[[Dhalsim (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Dhalsim (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area strikes with 100% Weaken effect vs Traitless enemies!<br>
[[Ken (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Ken (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs Red, Floating & Angels, plus Omnistrikes with Knockback effect!

<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" collab units from the "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" capsule set. "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition"units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※ If "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!}}<br>
Master martial artists gather from around the globe for an epic tournament!<br>
Get ready for a crossover showdown vs a star-studded lineup of the fierce fighters of Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Street Fighter"'''}}<br>
Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages to see the Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition crossover stages!<br>
Travel the world to defeat a series of world-class opponents! Choose to challenge the {{Color|#008000|'''EASY'''}}, {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''NORMAL'''}}, or {{Color|#335599|'''HARD'''}} difficulty versions of each stage.<br>
Clear each stage as fast as you can to collect all the Timed Score rewards available!

<small><small>※ Tap the Timed Score button on the map menu to preview the rewards available from these stages.</small></small>

Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock [[Ryu Cat (Rare Cat)|Ryu Cat]]'s True Form!

<small><small>※ You can activate Ryu Cat a the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!</small></small>

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Collab Maps: "New Challenger"'''}}<br>
A mystery opponent awaits you for a warrior's duel!<br>
"New Challenger" stages will appear as a Blitz event throughout this collaboration at the following times!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・6:00am ~ 7:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・9:00am ~ 10:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・12:00pm ~ 1:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・3:00pm ~ 4:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・6:00pm ~ 7:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・9:00pm ~ 10:59am'''}}

A random hero from the cast of Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition will appear to face your Cats in various New Challenger maps!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''Easy'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Expert'''}} difficulty versions of each stage will be available for you to take on!<br>
If you any defeat 4 opponents the final stage will appear with the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''ultimate fighter'''}} ready to punish your overconfidence!<br>
Prove your power and defeat this last boss for a chance to unlock a limited edition Collab unit as a clear reward!

<small><small>※Get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} chance to collect stage rewards when you use the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● "I Seek the Strongest!" appears in the Arena of Honor'''}}<br>
Who is the greatest fighter of them all?!<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, a special "Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition" Dojo Ranking Event is here and it's time to prove yourself! Select {{Color|#FF00CC|'''"I Seek the Strongest!"'''}} at the Catclaw Dojo and aim for the top score as you face off against might marital artists from this limited collab event!<br>
Climb to the highest ranks of the world warriors as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players!<br>
Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings! Do you have what it takes to be the strongest?

<small><small>※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. <br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards!<br>
Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the {{Color|#008000|'''Special Collab Unit "'''}}[[Chun-Li Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Chun-Li Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#008000|'''"'''}} for your Cat Army!

<small><small>※ You can activate Chun-Li Cat at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!</small></small>

For more information on Street Fighter V: Arcade Edition, visit the site below!<br>
http://www.capcom.co.jp/sfv/

